LAYERS 5 1
LAYER 1 1 0 Process
LAYER 2 1 0 Notes
LAYER 3 1 0 Equipment
LAYER 4 1 0 Hydraulic
LAYER 5 1 0 Electrical
GRAVITY 1.00
ON 1
ON 2
LABEL 24.00 90.00 ELECTRO-HYDRAULIC PRESS\nHold SB1: K1 / Y1 drive the press down;\nat the bottom (A1) K1 drops, K2 / Y2\ntake it up until A0. SB0 stops it.
